    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80436" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελειάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, = foreg. <i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i>, mostly in pl. , <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			11.634
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			2.55
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			223
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Andr.</u>
			1140
		</span></i>, etc. ; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρήρωσι πελειάσιν . . ὁμοῖαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.778
