					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.351
				</span></i>
			 : in sg. , <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1081
			</span></i> (lyr.) : distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστερά</span>, <i><span class="en">
