				<u>HA</u>
				544b2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				597b3
			</span></i> ; but used for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστερά</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.394d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.110
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				189
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> an Indian
				<i>fruitpigeon, Crocopus chlorogaster</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				16.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			= foreg. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.55
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				172
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
